  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Indirect speech",
     "texto": [
      "**Spune că** means \"says that\". The conjunction **că** introduces a sentence with a verb; it is never dropped, unlike in some English reporting."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Fact and opinion",
     "texto": [
      "**Potrivit textului** is equivalent to \"according to the text\". **Afirmă** presents a statement; **consideră** introduces an opinion."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
  },
